#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/sdl.xml:83
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of sdl12-compat"
msgstr "Instalação do sdl12-compat"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/sdl.xml:86
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>sdl12-compat</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>sdl12-compat</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/sdl.xml:90
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"cmake -D CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr \\\n"
"      -D CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=RELEASE  \\\n"
"      ..  &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"cmake -D CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr \\\n"
"      -D CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=RELEASE  \\\n"
"      ..  &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/sdl.xml:99
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr "Agora, como o(a) usante <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/sdl.xml:102
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>make install &amp;&amp;\n"
"rm -vf /usr/lib/libSDLmain.a</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>make install &amp;&amp;\n"
"rm -vf /usr/lib/libSDLmain.a</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/sdl.xml:108
#, xml-text
msgid "Testing SDL"
msgstr "Testando a SDL"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/sdl.xml:111
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you wish, test the <application>sdlcompat</application> package using the"
" included test programs. It is not required to install any of the resulting "
"binaries to validate the installation."
msgstr ""
"Se desejar, teste a instalação do pacote "
"<application>sdlcompat</application> usando os aplicativos de teste "
"incluídos. Não é exigido instalar nenhum dos binários resultantes para "
"validar a instalação."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/sdl.xml:117
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"You'll need to manually run all the test programs (they are listed in the "
"<filename>README</filename> file in this directory).  Many of them will need"
" to be manually killed, and you'll need to turn your speakers on with the "
"volume at a suitable level."
msgstr ""
"Você precisará executar manualmente todos os aplicativos de teste (eles "
"estão listados no arquivo <filename>README</filename> nesse diretório). "
"Muitos deles precisarão ser eliminados manualmente e você precisará ligar "
"teus alto-falantes com o volume em um nível adequado."

